1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,742
The Early Bird
早起的鸟儿

2
00:00:00,742 --> 00:00:02,382
Catches the Worm (Maybe)
抓住虫子（也许）

3
00:00:02,382 --> 00:00:04,296
Story by S v
S v的故事

4
00:00:04,296 --> 00:00:04,702
Richard
理查德

5
00:00:04,702 --> 00:00:05,419
Bud is a bird
巴德是一只鸟

6
00:00:05,419 --> 00:00:07,201
He wakes up early to catch a worm
他早起去抓虫子

7
00:00:07,737 --> 00:00:09,201
Bud is very hungry
Bud很饿

8
00:00:09,377 --> 00:00:10,362
Will is a worm
Will是条虫子

9
00:00:10,537 --> 00:00:11,961
He moves around in the dirt
他在泥土里走来走去

10
00:00:12,096 --> 00:00:13,775
Will sees Bud flying in the sky
威尔看到巴德在天上飞

11
00:00:13,776 --> 00:00:17,282
Bud is looking for food "I must hide," says Will
巴德正在寻找食物，“我必须藏起来，”威尔说

12
00:00:17,577 --> 00:00:18,922
Will moves to the grass
威尔走向草地

13
00:00:19,097 --> 00:00:22,361
He still sees Bud flying in the sky "I am not safe here
他还看到Bud在天上飞"我在这里不安全

14
00:00:22,376 --> 00:00:23,977
I must hide somewhere else "
我必须藏在别的地方”

15
00:00:23,977 --> 00:00:25,361
Will moves near a tree
会在一棵树附近移动

16
00:00:25,457 --> 00:00:26,762
He hides in the shade
他躲在阴凉处

17
00:00:26,977 --> 00:00:30,242
Bud flies around the tree "The shade does not hide me!"
芽绕着树飞“树荫藏不住我！”

18
00:00:30,376 --> 00:00:31,736
Will moves to the garden
威尔搬到花园

19
00:00:31,736 --> 00:00:37,448
He still sees Bud flying in the sky "I must find some place safe to hide " Will says
他仍然看到巴德在天上飞“我必须找个安全的地方藏起来”威尔说

20
00:00:37,536 --> 00:00:40,762
Will looks around and disappears as Bud swoops down
威尔环顾四周，巴德俯冲下来时，他消失了

21
00:00:41,377 --> 00:00:44,642
Bud eats some bird seeds that he finds on the ground
巴德吃了一些他在地上找到的鸟的种子

22
00:00:45,137 --> 00:00:47,055
Bud did not see Will
Bud没看到Will

23
00:00:47,057 --> 00:00:50,536
Bud flies away as Will pokes his head out of an apple that fell from the tree!
巴德飞走了，威尔从树上掉下来的苹果里探出头来！

24
00:00:50,536 --> 00:00:53,241
Will smiles and says "That was close!"
威尔微笑着说：“差一点！”

